  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/IMG_3983.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">40 fotos del inicio de los entrenamientos para la sexta edici&oacute;n del Onda Summer Contest, </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/HorariOndaSummerContest.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 483px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">que tomar&aacute; fuerza la tarde de este s&aacute;bado, hasta las 21.30 horas, en el Skate Park municipal de la calle Segorbe, junto al parque comarcal de bomberos y el Centro de Emergencias. Las finales ser&aacute;n la tarde del domingo.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontes16dissabte/img_3979.jpg\" alt=\"img_3979\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontes16dissabte/img_3980.jpg\" alt=\"img_3980\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontes16dissabte/img_3982.jpg\" alt=\"img_3982\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontes16dissabte/img_3983.jpg\" alt=\"img_3983\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontes16dissabte/img_3984.jpg\" alt=\"img_3984\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontes16dissabte/img_3985.jpg\" alt=\"img_3985\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439